# Maralen, Fae Ascendant: the number is of Elves and Faeries you control when the spell is cast (CR 601.2), and it covers every
# card exiled with her this turn, whenever in the turn. Maralen's own trigger exiles Bot2's Runeclaw Bear and an Island: the Bear has
# mana value 2, Maralen is the only Elf or Faerie (once, though she is both), so it can't be cast. Llanowar Elves enters, its
# trigger exiles a Grizzly Bear and a Mountain, and with two the Runeclaw Bear can be cast for no mana, from the first pair.
# A land is no spell: neither Island nor Mountain can be cast or played from exile. The Bear's cast uses up the permission:
# the Grizzly Bear, also mana value 2, is not offered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
